  "headline": "Esmolol hydrochloride is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; our supply traces to a repack plant classified VAI on 2024-09-11",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "E4", "E3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows esmolol hydrochloride is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our current label for the product names Medical Purchasing Solutions, LLC as the repack plant (FEI 3014288534).",
      "cites": ["E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1249077 at that plant ended on 2024-09-11 and was classified VAI, with the classification known to FDA on 2024-11-15.",
      "cites": ["E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 214 vials of the 100 mg/10 mL presentation at 10.7 vials per day, giving 19.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 386 vials at 13.9 vials per day, giving 27.8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked purchasing option is to buy from Amneal Pharmaceuticals LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Secondary options are Baxter Healthcare Company and Baxter Healthcare Corporation, also not on the shortage list, with no plant placement from their labels.",
      "cites": ["D5", "D6"]
    }
  ]
}
